What Is the Quantum Stealth Market?
The Quantum Stealth Market covers technologies, materials, and solutions designed to manipulate visible light to produce optical concealment effects. Unlike conventional camouflage, which relies primarily on colors, patterns, or environmental blending, optical cloaking seeks to alter how light travels around or interacts with an object.

Product development focuses on optical performance, material flexibility, durability, and the ability to manufacture larger sheets or panels. Commercial adoption depends on demonstrating reliable results under varying illumination and environmental conditions, as well as meeting the specific requirements of defense and civilian customers.

